        "description": "Aggregates Copernicus Global Flood Monitoring (GFM) layers over a selected area and time period using temporal statistics such as maximum, mean, sum, median, minimum, or count. It supports rapid flood-event summaries, including maximum observed flood extent, flood frequency, and counts of flooded or valid observations.",
